          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78402,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per controllare il numero di volte in cui si ripete un ciclo <code>while</code>, iniziamo con una variabile impostata su un numero. Chiamiamo questa variabile <strong>variabile contatore</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poi usiamo un confronto nella condizione per confrontare la variabile counter con un numero. In questo caso, <code>counter &lt; 4:</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>counter</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e poi <code>4</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo un confronto nella condizione per confrontare la variabile contatore con un numero.</p><p>Mantieni in esecuzione il ciclo finché il contatore è minore di <code>4</code>. Metti <code>counter</code> a sinistra e il numero a destra.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>counter</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code>, <code>4</code> e infine <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno del blocco di codice, facciamo in modo che la condizione restituisca <code>False</code> e interrompiamo il ciclo incrementando la variabile contatore.</p><p>In questo caso <code>+=</code> aumenta di <code>1</code> il valore della variabile <code>counter</code> ogni volta che il ciclo viene eseguito. Prova con <code>counter += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>counter += 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the condition",
            "id": 78386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Modificare la condizione indica al ciclo quando fermarsi. Ad esempio, modificando la condizione in <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"31\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambiare il valore della variabile counter cambia il momento in cui inizia il ciclo. Ad esempio, impostando <code>counter</code> su <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code in the code block",
            "id": 78387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'ordine del tuo codice influisce su ciò che viene visualizzato nella console. Inserisci prima <code>counter += 1</code>, per visualizzare da <code>6</code> a <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>counter += 1</code>, seguito da <code>print(counter)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'ordine delle due righe determina ciò che appare. Disponile in modo che il ciclo stampi i numeri da <code>6</code> a <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>counter += 1</code>, seguito da <code>print(counter)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 78384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il nome della variabile che usiamo per contare il numero di volte in cui un ciclo si ripete?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una variabile contatore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una variabile di monitoraggio</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una variabile contatore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una variabile usata per contare quante volte si ripete un ciclo è chiamata variabile contatore.</p><p><code>repeats</code> inizia da <code>0</code> e cresce ogni volta. Quale valore è il contatore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repeats</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il limite fisso del ciclo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La quantità aggiunta ogni volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>repeats</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 78383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la condizione di questo ciclo <code>while</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale espressione verifica Python prima di ogni ripetizione di questo ciclo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter += 1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(counter)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 78382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>counter += 1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aumenta <code>counter</code> di uno ogni volta che il ciclo esegue il suo blocco di codice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Crea la variabile contatore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aumenta <code>counter</code> di uno ogni volta che il ciclo esegue il suo blocco di codice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>counter += 1</code> aiuta questo ciclo a fermarsi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aumenta <code>counter</code> finché <code>counter &lt; 10</code> diventa <code>False</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Reimposta <code>counter</code> su <code>1</code> dopo ogni ripetizione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Crea una nuova variabile <code>counter</code> nel ciclo.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aumenta <code>counter</code> finché <code>counter &lt; 10</code> diventa <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
