            "id": 78381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo ciclo stampa <code>4</code> ma non <code>5</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con <code>5</code>, la condizione <code>counter &lt; 5</code> è <code>False</code> prima dell'esecuzione del blocco.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python interrompe automaticamente ogni ciclo dopo quattro ripetizioni.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'aggiornamento cambia <code>counter</code> direttamente da <code>4</code> a <code>6</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con <code>5</code>, la condizione <code>counter &lt; 5</code> è <code>False</code> prima dell'esecuzione del blocco.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
