            "id": 78380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(speed)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  speed += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I numeri da <code>2</code> a <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I numeri da <code>2</code> a <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se modificassi la prima riga in <code>speed = 3</code>, quali numeri mostrerebbe il ciclo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(speed)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  speed += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Da <code>3</code> a <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Da <code>2</code> a <code>4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Da <code>3</code> a <code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Da <code>3</code> a <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
